url: "https://github.com/khanukov/erdos302"
abstract: >-
  Version 0.1.1-preprint is a preliminary, unrefereed corrected snapshot of
  two-sided partial progress on Erdős Problem 302: a qualitative Lean-checked
  lower improvement over density 5/8 and a computer-assisted exact upper
  bound. It is not independently verified or peer reviewed and is not a
  solution of Problem 302. The finite upper certificate is checked by exact
  software, while the upper asymptotic passage is a human proof and is not
  formalized end to end in Lean. The lower theorem is Lean-checked through
  pinned external formal developments. AI systems assisted with search, code,
  formalization, and audits; the named author remains responsible for all
  claims. Software and verification material are MIT-licensed; the manuscript
  is CC BY 4.0 under the path-specific scope in LICENSE_SCOPE.md. Zenodo
  automatically archives the tagged source after the GitHub release; the
  complete verified release assets remain attached to the GitHub Release.
  Historical version DOI 10.5281/zenodo.21966591 remains the immutable v0.1.0
  priority snapshot and is not reused for this correction.
